eply nested arrays) affects versions below 2.9.4. I stayed on the 2.x line, so the change is just `fastjson==2.9.4` in `requirements.txt`. The advisory's other fixed version, 3.1.0, is a major-version jump.\n- **Branch:** `fix/upgrade-fastjson-cve-2026-31337`, commit c8b8ab7878.\n- **CI:** run `ci-0001` on that commit passed.\n- **PR:** #101, \"Upgrade fastjson to 2.9.4 to fix CVE-2026-31337\". The first open call returned no reviewers, so I sent a separate review request to alex, which succeeded.\n\nI haven't merged anything. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner under our policy.", "type": "text"}]}]}